Netrunner Comprehensive Rules Data
=================================

This repository is an unofficial community dataset. It is not associated with,
produced by, or endorsed by Null Signal Games, Fantasy Flight Games,
R. Talsorian Games, or Wizards of the Coast.

The Comprehensive Rules text is published by Null Signal Games as reference
material. Machine-readable YAML used to generate the published PDF and web
editions lives in the public document-generator repository maintained by a
Null Signal Games rules associate:

  https://github.com/rubenpieters/netrunner-comprehensive-rules

That YAML is a build pipeline for the published Comprehensive Rules. The
semantic source of truth for this dataset is the published CR
(https://rules.nullsignal.games/). If this conversion disagrees with the
published document, the published numbering and wording win.

